### 5. CREATE RESERVATION (your CRUD!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "7b71b5ec-a3ee-4329-a2c5-f7472d4955fa",
  "showId": "f4d45acf-76b3-4394-9d78-eb484d0a9850",
